  "id": 161,
  "description": "## 🔥 **[Y]ggdrasil [o]f [U]niverse Unyielding** 🔥\n**Ancient, wise, always strong. He who follows lives long.**\n\n**A guild for primary-focused players.**\n\nNot everyone focuses on combat, nor everyone likes assault. This is the guild exactly for that. Some of us will do the assault part, you can enjoy conquest buff by helping with guild challenges!\n\nStatus: OPEN\n\n### ✅ **Join Requirements**\n- Active player\n- Discord required\n- One primary skill level 90+, Total Level 1000+\n\n### 🚫 **Kick Conditions**\n- Inactive in-game for 7 days without notifying a leader\n- Not in the Guild Discord\n\n### 🎁 **Guild Benefits**\n- Extensive private data resources on everything, especially combat and dungeons\n- Giveaways\n- Discord server tag\n- Conquest buff over mid-level zones\n- No mandatory radis and assaults\n- Shooting Star &amp; World Boss pings\n- In-depth gameplay guides\n- In-game guild tag\n- ...and more!\n\n### ❗ **Join the YOU family Today!**\nContact **Littlechozy**, **jesquin** or **Limez** on Discord to join.\n\n### 🌐 **discord.gg/uwC6GQCTDa**",
